cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Ember: A workspace for Claude Code"
abstract: >-
  A local dashboard for inspecting Claude Code sessions: timelines, thinking
  blocks, tool calls, diffs, token usage, subagents and memory, with an embedded
  terminal, a live plan checklist, a configuration inventory that shows what each
  installed component costs in context, a file explorer and a visual output pane.
  Zero dependencies; runs on macOS, Linux and Windows.
type: software
